  ┌ Upgrade to v0.47.0 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  
  │                                                                                                                  │  
  │ dot-agent-deck CLI: update available: v0.47.0 (current: v0.46.0)                                                 │  
  │ Installed with Nix (/nix/store/abc-dot-agent-deck-0.46.0/bin/dot-agent-deck), so it is not changed from here.    │  
  │ Update your flake input (for example `nix flake update`) and rebuild, or run `nix profile upgrade`.              │  
  │ Upgrading does not restart the daemon on this machine, so its agents keep running. The next time you start the   │  
  │ TUI, it restarts a daemon running another version onto its own, asking first when agents are running on it.      │  
  │                                                                                                                  │  
  │ > Close                                                                                                          │  
  │                                                                                                                  │  
  │ Enter or Esc closes                                                                                              │  
  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
